     "content_html": "They were a highly militaristic people."
    },
    {
     "id": 1198403,
     "content_html": "They were a nonagricultural people."
    },
    {
     "id": 1198402,
     "content_html": "They engaged in peaceful religious expansion."
    },
    {
     "id": 1198401,
     "content_html": "They maintained a strong relationship with the Maya."
